{
  "project_id": 21,
  "project_label": "gemma",
  "task_id": 8429,
  "title": "How diversity makes teams more innovative",
  "author": "Rocío Lorenzo",
  "url": "https://www.ted.com/talks/rocio_lorenzo_how_diversity_makes_teams_more_innovative",
  "annotation_id": null,
  "completed_by": 7,
  "created_at": "2026-05-07T05:25:34.399439Z",
  "updated_at": "2026-05-07T05:25:34.399439Z",
  "lead_time": 61.397,
  "result": [
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "0",
        "end": "0",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 93,
        "text": "Fifteen years ago, I thought that the diversity stuff was not something I had to worry about.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "CB3945C596",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "1",
        "end": "1",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 54,
        "text": "It was something an older generation had to fight for.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "1B9F5DFC80",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "2",
        "end": "2",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 83,
        "text": "In my university, we were 50-50, male-female, and we women often had better grades.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "90E72C937E",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "3",
        "end": "3",
        "startOffset": 125,
        "endOffset": 131,
        "text": "right?",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "52F376848E",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "4",
        "end": "4",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 16,
        "text": "Well, not quite.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "6F0F7F86B0",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "5",
        "end": "5",
        "startOffset": 6,
        "endOffset": 26,
        "text": "moving up the ladder",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "555F226118",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "5",
        "end": "5",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 191,
        "text": "While moving up the ladder working as a management consultant across Europe and the US, I started to realize how often I was the only woman in the room and how homogenous leadership still is.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "12F97528CC",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "6",
        "end": "6",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 160,
        "text": "Many leaders I met saw diversity as something to comply with out of political correctness, or, best case, the right thing to do, but not as a business priority.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "1DFB1589D7",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "7",
        "end": "7",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 205,
        "text": "They just did not have a reason to believe that diversity would help them achieve their most immediate, pressing goals: hitting the numbers, delivering the new product, the real goals they are measured by.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "CB06EBFE96",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "8",
        "end": "8",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 170,
        "text": "moving up the ladder",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "D8A43D8A22",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "8",
        "end": "8",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 170,
        "text": "My personal experience working with diverse teams had been that while they require a little bit more effort at the beginning, they did bring fresher, more creative ideas.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "3E71FB648E",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "9",
        "end": "9",
        "startOffset": 21,
        "endOffset": 127,
        "text": "Are diverse organizations really more innovative, and can diversity be more than something to comply with?",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "B597F0FA5D",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "10",
        "end": "10",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 39,
        "text": "Can it be a real competitive advantage?",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "0B130C3674",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "11",
        "end": "11",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 74,
        "text": "So to find out, we set up a study with the Technical University of Munich.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "2C874BAC85",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "12",
        "end": "12",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 171,
        "text": "We surveyed 171 companies in Germany, Austria and Switzerland, and as we speak, we're expanding the study to 1,600 companies in five additional countries around the world.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "195D6C600E",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "13",
        "end": "13",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 96,
        "text": "We asked those companies basically two things: how innovative they are and how diverse they are.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "6CA928444D",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "14",
        "end": "14",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 65,
        "text": "To measure the first one, we asked them about innovation revenue.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "58E6B7CD17",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "15",
        "end": "15",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 303,
        "text": "root of the problem",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "4C9A28D091",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "15",
        "end": "15",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 303,
        "text": "Innovation revenue is the share of revenues they've made from new products and services in the last three years, meaning we did not ask them how many creative ideas they have, but rather if these ideas translate into products and services that really make the company more successful today and tomorrow.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "8C66850604",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "16",
        "end": "16",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 108,
        "text": "To measure diversity, we looked at six different factors: country of origin, age and gender, amongst others.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "7A9B423E04",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "17",
        "end": "17",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 131,
        "text": "While preparing to go in the field with those questions, I sat down with my team and we discussed what we would expect as a result.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "FC5DD38B3E",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "18",
        "end": "18",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 41,
        "text": "To put it mildly, we were not optimistic.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "HUMOR"
        ]
      },
      "id": "3BA1431A93",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "19",
        "end": "19",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 108,
        "text": "The most skeptical person on the team thought, or saw a real possibility, that we would find nothing at all.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "7031C4E995",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "20",
        "end": "20",
        "startOffset": 80,
        "endOffset": 87,
        "text": "only if",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "REP"
        ]
      },
      "id": "00BA2AF9A7",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "20",
        "end": "20",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 360,
        "text": "Most of the team was rather on the cautious side, so we landed all together at 'only if,' meaning that we might find some kind of link between innovation and diversity, but not across the board -- rather only if certain criteria are met, for example leadership style, very open leadership style that allowed people to speak up freely and safely and contribute.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "78D437C1B2",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "21",
        "end": "21",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 100,
        "text": "A couple of months later, the data came in, and the results convinced the most skeptical amongst us.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "F10F5EAF14",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "22",
        "end": "22",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 44,
        "text": "The answer was a clear yes, no ifs, no buts.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "9E712627A3",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "23",
        "end": "23",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 93,
        "text": "The data in our sample showed that more diverse companies are simply more innovative, period.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "85E259BB81",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "24",
        "end": "24",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 62,
        "text": "Now, a fair question to ask is the chicken or the egg question",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "918F99EF0B",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "24",
        "end": "24",
        "startOffset": 31,
        "endOffset": 62,
        "text": "the chicken or the egg question",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "30BCDE38FB",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "25",
        "end": "25",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 16,
        "text": "Which way is it?",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "549EBE2F8E",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "26",
        "end": "26",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 245,
        "text": "Now, we do not know how much is correlation versus causation, but what we do know is that clearly, in our sample, companies that are more diverse are more innovative, and that companies that are more innovative have more diverse leadership, too.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "9362ED562F",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "27",
        "end": "27",
        "startOffset": 48,
        "endOffset": 109,
        "text": "diversity driving innovation and innovation driving diversity",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "REP"
        ]
      },
      "id": "DF8BB2629E",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "27",
        "end": "27",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 110,
        "text": "So it's fair to assume that it works both ways, diversity driving innovation and innovation driving diversity.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "97FBDBCF64",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "28",
        "end": "28",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 87,
        "text": "Now, once we published the results, we were surprised about the reactions in the media.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "B68E3DEBD9",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "29",
        "end": "29",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 28,
        "text": "We got quite some attention.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "ECBA2670AA",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "30",
        "end": "30",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 113,
        "text": "And it went from quite factual, like \"Higher Female Share Boosts Innovation\" to a little bit more sensationalist.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "9DE872F91D",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "31",
        "end": "31",
        "startOffset": 11,
        "endOffset": 26,
        "text": "As you can see,",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "D0BB924DF5",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "31",
        "end": "31",
        "startOffset": 11,
        "endOffset": 120,
        "text": "As you can see, \"Stay-at-home Women Cost Trillions,\" and, my personal favorite, \"Housewives Kill Innovation.\"",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "2E90187A3F",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "32",
        "end": "32",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 52,
        "text": "Well, there's no such thing as bad publicity, right?",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "35CB6B78C7",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "33",
        "end": "33",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 175,
        "text": "(Laughter) On the back of that coverage, we started to get calls from senior executives wanting to understand more, especially -- surprise, surprise -- about gender diversity.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "EB608AE43E",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "34",
        "end": "34",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 117,
        "text": "I tend to open up those discussions by asking, \"Well, what do you think of the situation in your organization today?\"",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "D8C90BF4C3",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "35",
        "end": "35",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 88,
        "text": "And a frequent reaction to that is, \"Well, we're not yet there, but we're not that bad.\"",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "A2DF9D6CCE",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "36",
        "end": "36",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 60,
        "text": "One executive told me, for example, \"Oh, we're not that bad.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "6E41DDDF12",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "37",
        "end": "37",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 48,
        "text": "We have one member in our board who is a woman.\"",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "9949AD4393",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "38",
        "end": "38",
        "startOffset": 39,
        "endOffset": 54,
        "text": "Now, you laugh,",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "BB3A4F4E7D",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "38",
        "end": "38",
        "startOffset": 11,
        "endOffset": 278,
        "text": "And you laugh -- (Applause) Now, you laugh, but he had a point in being proud about it, because in Germany, if you have a company and it has one member on the board who is a woman, you are part of a select group of 30 out of the 100 largest publicly listed companies.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "E4DE583FCF",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "39",
        "end": "39",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 147,
        "text": "The other 70 companies have an all-male board, and not even one of these hundred largest publicly listed companies have, as of today, a female CEO.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "6BEA18A4E4",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "40",
        "end": "40",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 44,
        "text": "But here's the critically important insight.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "60DD71B088",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "41",
        "end": "41",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 67,
        "text": "Those few female board members alone, they won't make a difference.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "1A5920C178",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "42",
        "end": "42",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 132,
        "text": "Our data shows that for gender diversity to have an impact on innovation, you need to have more than 20 percent women in leadership.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "B3B74B918D",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "43",
        "end": "43",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 33,
        "text": "Let's have a look at the numbers.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "E73D28E068",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "44",
        "end": "44",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 92,
        "text": "As you can see, we divided the sample into three groups, and the results are quite dramatic.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "A8D39288D8",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "45",
        "end": "45",
        "startOffset": 24,
        "endOffset": 27,
        "text": "you",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "E9B3905C13",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "45",
        "end": "45",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 92,
        "text": "Only in the group where you have more than 20 percent women in leadership, only then you see",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "REP"
        ]
      },
      "id": "C1FD175C2B",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "46",
        "end": "46",
        "startOffset": 34,
        "endOffset": 37,
        "text": "you",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "DAF5D49A28",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "46",
        "end": "46",
        "startOffset": 63,
        "endOffset": 78,
        "text": "move the needle",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "817C324ACA",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "47",
        "end": "47",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 77,
        "text": "Another reaction I got quite a lot was, \"Well, it will get solved over time.\"",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "CC3FC9EFC7",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "48",
        "end": "48",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 104,
        "text": "And I have all the sympathy in the world for that point of view, because I used to think like that, too.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "59C548F3C2",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "49",
        "end": "49",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 88,
        "text": "Now, let's have a look here again and look at the numbers, taking Germany as an example.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "F91C3B1F33",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "50",
        "end": "50",
        "startOffset": 18,
        "endOffset": 21,
        "text": "you",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "60FD8BDD1D",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "51",
        "end": "51",
        "startOffset": 159,
        "endOffset": 199,
        "text": "pool in which to fish for female leaders",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "68E5966C4B",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "51",
        "end": "51",
        "startOffset": 102,
        "endOffset": 141,
        "text": "has grown nicely over the last 20 years",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "REP"
        ]
      },
      "id": "D627A8CC5D",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "52",
        "end": "52",
        "startOffset": 96,
        "endOffset": 107,
        "text": "in parallel",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "REP"
        ]
      },
      "id": "FBC3335D98",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "53",
        "end": "53",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 51,
        "text": "Now, let's have a look at what happened in reality.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "79FA90FA36",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "54",
        "end": "54",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 174,
        "text": "It's not even close, which means I was so wrong and which means that my generation, your generation, the best-educated female generation in history, we have just not made it.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "DCA424350D",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "55",
        "end": "55",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 60,
        "text": "We have failed to achieve leadership in significant numbers.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "458FFC44CB",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "56",
        "end": "56",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 49,
        "text": "Education just did not translate into leadership.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "18BE0087E1",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "57",
        "end": "57",
        "startOffset": 91,
        "endOffset": 108,
        "text": "we need to engage",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "546BC742AF",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "58",
        "end": "58",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 16,
        "text": "Now, what to do?",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "80F5B9F2BF",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "59",
        "end": "59",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 126,
        "text": "Achieving more than 20 percent women in leadership seems like a daunting task to many, understandably, given the track record.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "85A2D5245D",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "60",
        "end": "60",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 109,
        "text": "But it's doable, and there are many companies today that are making progress there and doing it successfully.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "D372C6F211",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "61",
        "end": "61",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 52,
        "text": "Let's take SAP, the software company, as an example.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "5A8DFBD778",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "62",
        "end": "62",
        "startOffset": 55,
        "endOffset": 80,
        "text": "They decided to do better",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "0CF7B3C71F",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "62",
        "end": "62",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 163,
        "text": "They had, in 2011, 19 percent women in leadership, yet they decided to do better, and they did what you do in any other area of business where you want to improve.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "6016A16A4E",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "63",
        "end": "63",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 40,
        "text": "They set themselves a measurable target.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "18FA19FA93",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "64",
        "end": "64",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 86,
        "text": "So they set themselves a target of 25 percent for 2017, which they have just achieved.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "3B70BEAE0B",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "65",
        "end": "65",
        "startOffset": 71,
        "endOffset": 99,
        "text": "tapping new recruiting pools",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "7630D146CD",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "65",
        "end": "65",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 100,
        "text": "The goals made them think more creatively about developing leaders and tapping new recruiting pools.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "E2FFDD339D",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "66",
        "end": "66",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 70,
        "text": "They now even set a target of 30 percent women in leadership for 2022.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "90D9508B0D",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "67",
        "end": "67",
        "startOffset": 60,
        "endOffset": 80,
        "text": "it all boils down to",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "C4DA9C0513",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "67",
        "end": "67",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 200,
        "text": "So experience shows it's doable, and at the end of the day, it all boils down to two decisions that are taken every day in every organization by many of us: who to hire and who to develop and promote.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "03348664BF",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "68",
        "end": "68",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 70,
        "text": "Now, nothing against women's programs, networks, mentoring, trainings.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "1AB2BAED54",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "69",
        "end": "69",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 12,
        "text": "All is good.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "08A3536959",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "70",
        "end": "70",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 114,
        "text": "But it is these two decisions that at the end of the day send the most powerful change signal in any organization.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "50BFA39818",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "71",
        "end": "71",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 48,
        "text": "Now, I never set out to be a diversity advocate.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "D979924847",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "72",
        "end": "72",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 24,
        "text": "I am a business advisor.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "4A0E28C72F",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "73",
        "end": "73",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 206,
        "text": "But now my goal is to change the face of leadership, to make it more diverse -- and not so that leaders can check a box and feel like they have complied with something or they have been politically correct.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "988C996B85",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "74",
        "end": "74",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 113,
        "text": "But because they understand, they understand that diversity is making their organization more innovative, better.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "16385355C9",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "75",
        "end": "75",
        "startOffset": 4,
        "endOffset": 55,
        "text": "by embracing diversity, by embracing diverse talent",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "REP"
        ]
      },
      "id": "E177CA433E",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "75",
        "end": "75",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 104,
        "text": "And by embracing diversity, by embracing diverse talent, we are providing true opportunity for everyone.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "5E948364B7",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "76",
        "end": "76",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 10,
        "text": "Thank you.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "4D2E682CE3",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "77",
        "end": "77",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 18,
        "text": "Thank you so much.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "1234F701D3",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "78",
        "end": "78",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 10,
        "text": "(Applause)",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "B540A7981F",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    }
  ]
}